homelab-dns-server (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. PowerDNS gpgsql provisioning via the native pdns.d
    drop-in directory (never edits pdns.conf), master/slave role toggle
    matching the real live topology, applies the official upstream
    schema (referenced from the installed pdns-backend-pgsql package)
    only if not already present, never touches the dkim_keys table
    living in the same database.

